    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH NATIONAL RESEARCH AGENCY (ANR)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The ANR is a French government agency that funded a research project involving Frédérique Bitton and CRPACA."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0423</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CLIMATE CHANGE MITIGATION STRATEGIES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Climate Change Mitigation Strategies is a research project funded by the ANR and conducted by Frédérique Bitton and CRPACA from 2015 to 2018."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0423</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATURE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Nature is a prestigious scientific journal where Frédérique Bitton published her latest study on the impact of climate change on ecosystems in the Sahel region."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0423</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AISHA ABUBAKAR&quot;">
